      \resumeItemListStart
        \item Extensive experience in continuous flow analysis (CFA) ice core melter systems and ice core impurity geochemistry (dust, sea salts, sulfur species (MSA, SO$_4$), heavy metals, fire tracers, water isotopes)
        \item Led projects measuring fire aerosols in the Denali ice core, re-interpreting Arctic MSA variability using atmospheric chemistry box modeling, and improving our understanding of impurities in the world's oldest (>1 million years) ice cores from the Allan Hills, Antarctica
      \resumeItemListEnd 
